  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FAUTAPO 2020-23 Women&apos;s Economic Empowerment &amp; market access - FAUTAPO 2020-23 Women&#xB4;s Economic Empowerment &amp; market access</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FAUTAPO 2020-23 Women&apos;s Economic Empowerment &amp; market access</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FAUTAPO har ans&#xF6;kt Sida om finansiering av 35 miljoner SEK f&#xF6;r att genomf&#xF6;ra projektet &quot;Women&apos;s Economic Empowerment and market access&quot; i Bolivia under perioden 2020-2023.

Insatsen syftar till att 1) f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttra kvinnors empowerment p&#xE5; olika niv&#xE5;er: ekonomiskt, socialt, ledande, produktivt; och 2) att s&#xE4;kerst&#xE4;lla tillg&#xE5;ng till lokala marknader f&#xF6;r de sm&#xE5; produktiva enheter som arbetar under det nuvarande bidraget f&#xF6;r att slutf&#xF6;r a sin ekonomiska cykel. D&#xE4;rmed kommer FAUTAPO att inf&#xF6;rliva en flerdimensionell fattigdomsanalys i enlighet med Sidas konceptuella ram.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FAUTAPO has applied to Sida for funding of 35 million SEK to carry out the project &quot;Women&apos;s Economic Empowerment and market access&quot; in Bolivia during the period 2020-2023.  

The intervention aims at 1) improving women&apos;s empowerment at different levels: economic, social, managerial, productive; and 2) ensuring access to local markets for the small productive units working under the present contribution complete their economic cycle. In doing so, FAUTAPO will apply a multidimensional poverty analysis in accordance to Sida&apos;s conceptual framework.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The final objective of the intervention was to improve men and women&apos;s socioeconomic empowerment of at least 80 percent of 2 100 productive units while also working with them in the opening of competitive markets for their production to be sold.

Other foreseen targets were stablished as follows:

* At least 12 products with added value are produced according to market demand.

* 40% of the selected products have improved volumes of production 

* 60% of the selected products have obtained SENASAG certfications</narrative>
  </description>
